libairspy-rs
============

This repository is a Rust port of airspyone_host, the C host support for
Airspy software-defined radio receivers:
https://github.com/airspy/airspyone_host

Two components are ported, and each keeps its upstream license:

libairspy (crates/libairspy, package `libairspy-rs`) — BSD-3-Clause,
matching the upstream libairspy library:

