  Copyright (c) 2014, Youssef Touil <youssef@airspy.com>
  Copyright (c) 2014, Benjamin Vernoux <bvernoux@airspy.com>
  Copyright (c) 2015, Ian Gilmour <ian@sdrsharp.com>

airspy-tools (crates/airspy-tools) — GPL-2.0-or-later, matching the
upstream airspy-tools utilities (based on the HackRF project):

  Copyright 2012 Jared Boone <jared@sharebrained.com>
  Copyright 2014-2015 Benjamin Vernoux <bvernoux@airspy.com>

The USB vendor requests, register sequences, filter kernels, and magic
constants in this repository are transcribed directly from the upstream
C source; each crate is a derivative of the corresponding upstream
component and is distributed under that component's license.

